// Name :
"P3555631364" "Barracuda"
// ProfessionString :
"P2610529159" "Captain Mako's Lieutenant"
// DescriptionString :
"P1870761036" "A former treasure hunter, Kelli Forston was infected by mysterious creatures known as the Coralax. What she found in the briny deep remains a mystery, but it turned her heart as dark and cold as the depths. In combat, she is almost as quick and savage as her bloodthirtsy mentor, Captain Mako.<br><br>Recently, Barracuda's been looking to expand her influence and operations and get out from under Captain Mako's thumb. She might be a good source of high profile, high paying jobs."
// LocationString :
"P3340683840" "Grandville"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P490923054" "I got an opportunity for you, {HeroName}, and I'm sure you're gonna help me out. This squint, Roderick Mueller, has a job he needs a little help with, and you're gonna give him the help he needs. Don't worry; he's gonna take good care of you for your help, and you're gonna take good care of me for cluing you in on this opportunity.<br><br>Mueller's got a line on some info he needs. The only problem is, that info is hidden in that Omega Team time capsule they got there.<color orange> The capsule's been moved to under City Hall, so this Mueller wants you to go in there and swipe that info.</color><br><br>Whadda say, {HeroName}? You in?"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2252485078" "No offense, {HeroName} but what I got, you can't handle. Why don't you come back when you're tougher and then we can talk. <color orange>Return to Barracuda when you are Level 45 or higher.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P1396491506" "I cower before your magnificence! (PlayerLevelTooHigh)"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3926938550" "I got some work for you, but you're gonna need a team of at least 4 people if you want to pull this one off.<br><br><color orange>You need to have at least 4 people on your team to start this strike force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2743050780" "Hey chump, I ain't got time for you. Find who's ever leading your mob and have them come talk to me."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P1175098363" "I ain't gonna give you the low-down until you're all ready to hear it. Make sure all of your teamies are here and then we can talk."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1171012267" "Some of those chumps with you are real chumps.<br><br><color orange>Make sure everyone on your team is level 45+</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P1640585644" "Thresher"
// TaskForceName :
"P2493048670" "Basking"
// TaskForceName :
"P3874960631" "Tiger"
// TaskForceName :
"P3311883156" "Great White"
// TaskForceName :
"P2626256144" "Hammerhead"
// TaskForceName :
"P2883066701" "Mako"
// HelloString :
"P4033969988" "What's going on, {HeroName}? You lookin' for something to do?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1658622802" "Funny thing is, I'm an auto-issue contact, so you should probably never see this."
// FirstVisitString :
"P856364347" ""
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1869189192" "I don't got anything left after that last little job, {HeroName}. Maybe we should just go our separate ways and not press our luck."
