// Contact Name : Lord Recluse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2939457459" "Lord Recluse"
// ProfessionString :
"P3062042871" "Ruler of the Rogue Isles"
// DescriptionString :
"P3346607204" "The Master of Evil, the Count of Cruel, the Archvillain of Anarchy. Lord Recluse has been called many things. But the people of the Rogue Isles know him as their lord and ruler. Lord Recluse had a mysterious tie with the now deceased Statesman - some even claim they were once close companions. Their hatred for one another certainly belies a secret perhaps best left buried."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P3194599137" "You have not proven yourself worthy! Work with your patron and we will see what the future will bring!"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1422637381" "I have witnessed your journey through the Rogue Isles. You have clawed your way to the top, performing all manner of vile act to prove yourself stronger and more capable then the rest of my Destined Ones. You have even bested one of my trusted lieutenants, a feat few have done before. In the end I thought you a liability, having used Project DESTINY to see into the future and witness a possible death of the world - my rightful domain! - at your hands. But you have a depth of villainy and strength more powerful than even I had imagined. You discovered my contingency plans and sent me a very clear warning as to what would happen if I enacted my plans, and it is something I will not forget!<br><br>You know of my plans for Project DESTINY, to engineer my eventual victory by manipulating the timestreams of the future, eliminating unfavorable results until only my ultimate triumph remains! And you know the greatest threat to my goals is that group, the Freedom Phalanx! Long have they been a thorn in my side, thwarting my operations at every turn. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you help me deal with the troublesome Freedom Phalanx, I will assure you a place of honor in my future triumph!</A>"
// TaskForceRewardRequiresText :
"P1791235094" "<color red>Warning!</color><br><color deepskyblue>The following characters in this group have recently completed this Strike Force, and will not be eligible for the Synthetic Hamidon reward available at the end of the final mission:<color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P3482098686" "You are truly a worthy peer. I respect your power!"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3412849071" "The task I have for you will require a full cadre of eight villains!"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P2344618786" "I need to speak to your leader, not a mere underling!"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3310976415" "Bring the leader of your cadre to me!"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P3171711404" "Do not waste my time! The task I have requires at least eight villains of at least Threat Level 45!"
// TaskForceName :
"P1428825275" "Strike Force Redback"
// TaskForceName :
"P3791107374" "Strike Force Tarantula"
// TaskForceName :
"P1502707475" "Strike Force Venom"
// TaskForceName :
"P4171902226" "Strike Force Widowmaker"
// HelloString :
"P2343313396" "Let us continue, {TaskForceName}!"
// HelloString :
"P1384768977" "The plan progresses well, {TaskForceName}!"
// HelloString :
"P4280322150" "Victory is within our grasp, {TaskForceName}!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P246668452" "You will be known as {TaskForceName}!"
// SOLFirstVisitString :
"P3740377436" "<em=point>You will be known as {TaskForceName}!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4241675623" "We shall meet again!"
